    "detailed_description": "TACTICAL is a challenging combination of puzzle and top-down shooter. You have one objective: eliminate all of the security robots. The catch is that you must not be discovered and only shots to the back will be effective.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Study patrol patterns and formulate your plan of attack.</li><li>Sneak through the level unseen as you pick off your targets.</li><li>Eliminate enemies in tactical locations to lure your next target into position.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>40 Unique levels.</li><li>Each chapter adds new mechanics.</li><li>Levels get progressively more challenging as you complete them.</li><li>Culminating in a series of epic multi-part levels that will test all the skills you have developed.</li><li>Earn in-game trophies by completing levels within the specified times.</li><li>See your Global Ranking for each level.</li><li>10 Steam Achievements to unlock.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "TACTICAL is a challenging combination of puzzle and top-down shooter. You have one objective: eliminate all of the security robots. The catch is that you must not be discovered and only shots to the back will be effective.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Study patrol patterns and formulate your plan of attack.</li><li>Sneak through the level unseen as you pick off your targets.</li><li>Eliminate enemies in tactical locations to lure your next target into position.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>40 Unique levels.</li><li>Each chapter adds new mechanics.</li><li>Levels get progressively more challenging as you complete them.</li><li>Culminating in a series of epic multi-part levels that will test all the skills you have developed.</li><li>Earn in-game trophies by completing levels within the specified times.</li><li>See your Global Ranking for each level.</li><li>10 Steam Achievements to unlock.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "TACTICAL is a challenging combination of puzzle and top-down shooter. You have one objective: eliminate all of the security robots. The catch is that you must not be discovered and only shots to the back will be effective.",
